<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani banks shut for elections.</title>
<headline>Pakistani banks shut for elections.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan and other banks were shut on Monday because of national and provincial elections. They will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
